    "enUS": {
      "description": "Here, take this pouch and give it to Sea Wolf.  And tell him I meant to pay him back!  I swear!!\n\nI just got a little drunk and lost my way, and...you know how things are.  He'll understand - you don't have to get rough!",
      "summary": "Bring Shaky's Payment to \"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley.",
      "title": "Return to MacKinley",
